        <p class="adv-card__tag">Scenic Drive</p>
        <h3 class="adv-card__name">Scenic Drives</h3>
        <p class="adv-card__desc">AR Highway 7 has been called one of America's most scenic byways — 115 miles of forested ridges, river valleys, and small-town charm between Harrison and Hot Springs. AR-21 through the heart of the Ozarks and the Pig Trail Scenic Byway are close contenders.</p>
        <div class="adv-card__stops">
          <span class="adv-card__stop">AR Highway 7</span>
          <span class="adv-card__stop">AR Highway 21</span>
          <span class="adv-card__stop">Pig Trail Byway</span>
        </div>
        <a href="https://www.arkansas.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="adv-card__link">Plan Your Drive</a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Jesse James Trail -->
    <article class="adv-card adv-card--featured">
      <div class="adv-card__img">
        <div class="adv-card__img-bg" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2a1505 0%, #5a2a0a 40%, #1a0a02 100%);"></div>
        <div class="adv-card__icon">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"/></svg>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="adv-card__body">
        <p class="adv-card__tag">Legend & History</p>
        <h3 class="adv-card__name">The Jesse James Trail</h3>
        <p class="adv-card__desc">Live the legend. Jesse James and his gang called the southern Ozarks home for years — hiding out in the same hills your cabin sits in. This self-drive trail hits the key outlaw sites: Carthage, Missouri's historic courthouse (site of the 1865 massacre), Galena's Minnie's Cafe (an outlaw roadhouse), the Pearl River caves, and the famous Carter's Creek Crossing shootout site. The lore is thick. The drive is beautiful.</p>
        <div class="adv-card__stops">
          <span class="adv-card__stop">Carthage, MO</span>
          <span class="adv-card__stop">Galena, MO</span>
          <span class="adv-card__stop">Pearl River Caves</span>
          <span class="adv-card__stop">Carter's Creek Crossing</span>
          <span class="adv-card__stop">Ozark outlaw hideouts</span>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
          <a href="https://www.nps.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="adv-card__link adv-card__link--amber">Research the Trail</a>
          <a href="/listings" class="adv-card__link adv-card__link--outlined">Book a Cabin Base</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Missing Gold -->
    <article class="adv-card adv-card--featured" style="flex-direction: row-reverse;">
      <div class="adv-card__img">
        <div class="adv-card__img-bg" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a0e02 0%, #3d2205 40%, #2a1502 100%);"></div>
        <div class="adv-card__icon">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"/></svg>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="adv-card__body">
        <p class="adv-card__tag">Ozarks Legend</p>
        <h3 class="adv-card__name">The Missing Gold</h3>
        <p class="adv-card__desc">They say Jesse James buried it somewhere along the Buffalo River — a chest of Union gold coins stolen during the Civil War, never recovered. Every local has a theory. Some say it's near a specific limestone bluff above Pruitt. Others swear it's somewhere near Rich Creek. The search has consumed treasure hunters for over 150 years. Nobody's found it. Yet. The best time to hunt? Late autumn, when the leaves are down and the river's low.</p>
        <div class="adv-card__stops">
          <span class="adv-card__stop">Buffalo River</span>
          <span class="adv-card__stop">Pruitt, AR</span>
          <span class="adv-card__stop">Rich Creek</span>
          <span class="adv-card__stop">Limestone bluffs</span>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
          <a href="https://www.nps.gov/buff" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="adv-card__link adv-card__link--amber">Explore Buffalo River</a>
          <a href="/listings" class="adv-card__link adv-card__link--outlined">Stay Near the Trail</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
